{"author":"schacon@gmail.com","body":"The current TUI (ti tui) is a basic list view. Improvements to make it a real working environment:\n\n- Detail pane: press Enter or right-arrow to open a ticket detail view showing full description, comments, tags, spec, sub-issues\n- Inline actions: change state (s), add comment (c), assign (a), tag (t), close (x) without leaving the TUI\n- Filtering: type / to filter by title, tab through status/state/tag filters\n- Sort toggle: press o to cycle sort orders\n- Sub-issue tree: show parent/child relationships with indentation or tree view\n- Color coding: status and state colors matching the CLI output\n- Responsive layout: adapt columns to terminal width, hide less important fields on narrow terminals"}